Package: quadriceps
Title: Positive-Weight Cubature Rules for the Gaussian Weight and the Cube
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joris", "Pinkse", email = "pinkse@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Moustapha", "Diallo", role = "cph",
           comment = "some of the stored rules for the cube descend from his published rules (MIT license, see LICENSE.note)"))
Description: Positive-weight cubature rules in several dimensions for the
    Gaussian weight (ghpos) and the uniform weight on the cube (lepos): the
    smallest rules known to the author for dimensions 2 to 5, with a fallback
    to the cheapest tensor product of lower-dimensional rules elsewhere. The
    rules are described in Pinkse (2026) <doi:10.5281/zenodo.22904159>. The R
    twin of the 'Julia' package 'Quadriceps.jl'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/NittanyLion/quadriceps-r
BugReports: https://github.com/NittanyLion/quadriceps-r/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
